{{define "content"}}
<h1>Sync / 配置同步</h1>

{{if .Uploaded}}
<div class="notice ok">Uploaded remote snapshot: {{.RemoteFile}}</div>
{{end}}
{{if .Pulled}}
<div class="notice ok">Pulled remote snapshot: {{.RemoteFile}}<br>{{.Result}}</div>
{{end}}

<section class="card">
  <p>Upload writes a full local configuration snapshot to WebDAV. Pull treats the newest remote snapshot as authoritative and replaces local stations and mappings to match it.</p>
  <p class="muted">The snapshot includes station upstream API keys and mappings. It does not include the Local API Key, runtime file path, listen address, database path, status, or logs.</p>
  <p class="muted">Upload 和 Pull 共用同一组 WebDAV 凭据。Device name 仅在 Upload 时写入远端文件名，Pull 时忽略。</p>
</section>

<form class="card" method="post" action="/admin/sync/upload">
  <input type="hidden" name="write_token" value="{{.WriteToken}}">
  <h2>WebDAV Endpoint</h2>
  <div class="grid-2">
    <label class="field">
      <span class="field-label">WebDAV URL</span>
      <span class="field-hint">Parent directory URL. Snapshots are stored under allenlucasAIProxyTool/.</span>
      <input name="webdav_url" placeholder="https://dav.example.com/local-relay-gateway/" required>
    </label>
    <label class="field">
      <span class="field-label">Device name</span>
      <span class="field-hint">Used in the remote filename when uploading; ignored on pull.</span>
      <input name="device_name" value="{{.DeviceName}}" required>
    </label>
    <label class="field">
      <span class="field-label">Username</span>
      <input name="username" autocomplete="username">
    </label>
    <label class="field">
      <span class="field-label">Password / Token</span>
      <input name="password" type="password" autocomplete="new-password">
    </label>
  </div>
  <div class="actions actions-split">
    <button type="submit">Upload Current Config</button>
    <button type="submit"
            class="subtle"
            formaction="/admin/sync/pull"
            data-confirm="Pull remote config and replace local stations and mappings?">
      Pull Remote Config
    </button>
  </div>
</form>
{{end}}
